<title>UK: McAlpine shareholders approve Raine deal.</title>
<headline>McAlpine shareholders approve Raine deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in British construction firm Alfred McAlpine Plc have voted to approve the acqusition of Raine Plc, McAlpine said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Approval for the 44 million stg deal was secured at an extraordinary general meeting on Wednesday. McAlpine has 67 percent of housebuilder Raine.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
